  // FIRST BATCH OF THE MAIN LANTHANIDE SERIES (Ce-Ho this batch; Er-Lu land next batch, then period 6's d-block). Most abundant lanthanide -- more abundant in Earth's crust than copper. UFF LJ. Real, precisely measured EA (0.600 eV, Fu et al. 2020 cold-ion-trap photoelectron spectroscopy) -- flagged as unusually solid for this batch, see the batch-wide note on lanthanide EA scarcity below.
